module DASHI.Physics.YangMills.BalabanCMP98Equation119SU2InstanceRound149Exact where

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- ROUND149 A1: THE Eq. (119) REALIZATION AT THE CONCRETE SU(2) CARRIER
--
-- Round146 realizes CMP98 Eq. (119) on the periodic lattice for an arbitrary
-- gauge group and adjoint module.  The repository already owns a concrete
-- compact gauge group: the unit quaternions `su2QuaternionGroup` with the
-- literal adjoint action Ad_u X = u X conj(u) on the three imaginary
-- coordinates.  This module instantiates the realization there.
--
-- What becomes concrete at SU(2):
--
--   * the background V0 is an actual unit-quaternion field on the lattice;
--   * R_0 is the su(2)-valued line integral with Ad-transport by that field;
--   * R(e^{iY_x}) and R(e^{iY}) are the literal Ad of unit quaternions;
--   * the blocks, the three paths of (119) and L^{-d} are unchanged;
--   * gauge covariance at the coarse root is inherited from Round146.
--
-- What is *not* closed here, and is the honest remaining seam of the A1 cut:
-- the two ad-functional-calculus operators g(-i ad Y) and g^{-1}(-i ad Y_x) of
-- CMP98 Sect. A are still parameters of the instance.  Producing them at SU(2)
-- requires the convergent functional calculus of Sect. A over the repository's
-- real-number surface; that is a separate analytic obligation and this module
-- deliberately does not pretend to discharge it.
--
-- This module is not `--safe`: the SU(2) quaternion carrier is built over
-- `DASHI.Foundations.RealAnalysisAxioms`, whose reals are postulated in this
-- repository.  Round146, Round147 and Round148 remain postulate-free.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

